{"reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "一定会萧条吗？如果一次技术的繁荣跟着另一次技术的繁荣，那么会有萧条吗，及所谓企业发展的二次曲线，还是说整个人类的集体会疲惫？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "2004年后康波进入衰退阶段，而第五次康波的标志性技术创新为信息技术。", "range": "2748-2783", "reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "userVid": 428233135, "topics": [], "createTime": 1746526152, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 428233135, "name": "刘鑫", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/nbHpC9gtlFCWUWzq1fDFe4JKLLsq2RLhLt4jzgwj8cwAicg5sibzueCAFmWIkZeCbsdeafTfBuI7I/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240701-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 300629636, "name": "勇", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKdkcichlWLUPauibNR0EBxqJibco70qGvogH3KyN4kbIkAL3GicmRj0l7cSLcj2CrKqvLhvjQ0qN4DYPLjhK1RxnticQiblq0Odcibdl3mfJBHmkTcQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240916-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我粗略听了两遍，大致意思是因为资源价格和消费主导国需求萎缩原因。而当你的资源投入目前已知技术时，不可能立马有另一项更先进生产效率更高的技术横空出世。", "reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "commentId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs_c426066534_88dvKGjJg", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1775661255, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "content": "就像现在的ai，全世界都投入了大量的人力物力财力，这些成果转化为产品需要一段时间，然后必然经历一波供给扩张，然后被动出库存，主动出库存……那就伴随着繁荣，减缓和萧条了。\n别说世界，我们个体，进职称后还会等一段再奋发呢", "toUserVid": 426066534, "toCommentId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs_c426066534_88dvKGjJg", "commentId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs_c917607060_88Kt9kl8O", "userVid": 917607060, "createTime": 1777533278, "likesCount": 3, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 917607060, "name": "利行萍踪", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/dx4Y70y9XctpHZ9ySrIYe6X3aOakMpcNQz5yFmQGqcYwQb3pz7m9FFfYUG0b5KybQ9VHicyvjL2k/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "利行萍踪", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "在阅读中寻求力量", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250331-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "我理解的是一个行业的萧条也会同步带来另外一些替代行业的逐步繁荣，但是享受红利期的人群不同，上一个行业的人大多数来不及切换新行业所需的技能，这种繁荣和萧条都是相对的", "reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "commentId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs_c17934714_88a1RfCd8", "userVid": 17934714, "createTime": 1775463467, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17934714, "name": "筱女子 ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q3auHgzwzM4ficicNDBER4Rq2hERsSawXXIacic6gOecKrYadShEeToicj9ezCDGkJ8RVfj9pn3zHlLAW0FuKpfxd5ctJiaNQxLE3GACebe91onSskoAfFF7VoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-50", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 50}}}, {"content": "有阴就有阳啊，有繁荣必然有萧条", "reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "commentId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs_c3480384_86JSccp0U", "userVid": 3480384, "createTime": 1770456194, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 3480384, "name": "宁静致远", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/sTJptKvBQLIOSCKkv9ju5p0ZYN3WVGpfD89UlrfahWIHoGSl7aB8C5dN0B41ocmt7icTjiccdQ3o8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-200", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 200}}}, {"content": "技术a的繁荣应该是会吸入大量资金的，技术b在技术a的基础上想繁荣应该是会虹吸技术a的资金。这个时候应该就是萧条点吧，毕竟船大难调头。", "reviewId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs", "commentId": "428233135_7ZWztZkGs_c322049799_86cy4HHdU", "userVid": 322049799, "createTime": 1768563353, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 322049799, "name": "高人竟在我身边", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-BwDCBhHrDjzEQVI6X~zOJfa/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "高人竟在我身边", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1790341162}